nAlso Health Warnings / Tiered Delivery: Branch C description could mention the docs epic. Update the branch C bullet in Tier 2.\n\nAlso need to check the strategy file for reference (Step 1 says read it). Let me read it, the BRANCH-B epic, an ai-signals file, and get the epic-task schema.\n\nLet me also check frontmatter.py schema epic-task to fill required fields for the new epic.","signature":"ad287d63ccd74cc0b85c24b649314382"}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":25516,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a3e7679c48fa5da5","agent_id":"a84b1f058f9da17e6","session_id":"c797c45b-eabe-4faf-a684-66c1833f1941","uuid":"0e54de9e-33e9-491e-be6f-ef0316721176","timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:38:00.920Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-8004 decomposition"}
